{"RukuNumber":269,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":83,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"أَلَمۡ تَرَ أَنَّآ أَرۡسَلۡنَا ٱلشَّيَٰطِينَ عَلَى ٱلۡكَٰفِرِينَ تَؤُزُّهُمۡ أَزّٗا","TajweedText":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَرْسَلْنَا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>شَّيَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>طِينَ عَلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْكَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>فِرِينَ تَؤُزُّهُمْ أَزًّا <span class=end>٨٣</span>","End":"٨٣","PageNumber":311,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":269,"MaqraNumber":124,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":84,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَلَا تَعۡجَلۡ عَلَيۡهِمۡۖ إِنَّمَا نَعُدُّ لَهُمۡ عَدّٗا","TajweedText":"فَلَا تَعْجَلْ عَلَيْهِمْ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َمَا نَعُدُّ لَهُمْ عَدًّا <span class=end>٨٤</span>","End":"٨٤","PageNumber":311,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":269,"MaqraNumber":124,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":85,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"يَوۡمَ نَحۡشُرُ ٱلۡمُتَّقِينَ إِلَى ٱلرَّحۡمَٰنِ وَفۡدٗا","TajweedText":"يَوْمَ نَحْشُرُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُتَّقِينَ إِلَى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>رَّحْمَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>نِ وَفْدًا <span class=end>٨٥</span>","End":"٨٥","PageNumber":311,"JuzNumber":16,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":269,"MaqraNumber":124,"HizbNumber":31,"HizbDecimal":0.75,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":19,"SurahIndex":"019","VerseNumber":86,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَنَسُوقُ ٱلۡمُجۡرِمِينَ إِلَىٰ جَهَنَّمَ وِرۡدٗا","TajweedText":"وَنَسُوقُ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمُ<tajweed class=qal